      "value": "Translated with DeepL.com (free version)\n\n# Regarding the issue where pressing the Y key causes the chat box to close unexpectedly\n\nDescription\n\nAfter pressing the Y key to open the chat box, if I press the Y key even once while typing a message, the chat box closes unexpectedly. Since I can’t chat this way, I’d like you to address this issue as soon as possible. Thank you for your cooperation.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI keep an external tool—such as Notepad—open on my PC that allows text input. Whenever I want to type something into the in-game chat box, I type it into the external tool, copy it, and then paste it into the in-game chat box to send it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-18_00-06-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_2c267abb-129a-4cfb-8cb9-1c08071afc6a/1/file)",
